@startuml
!include style.puml
title SD08 — Adapter calls and bounded structured-output retry
participant "caller: EventPlanningFacade\nor AdaptivePlanningService" as F
participant EventPlanningAgent as A
participant "model: GeminiAdapter\nimplements AIModel" as Adapter
participant GeminiAPIClient as Client
participant "Google GenAI SDK / Gemini API" as API
F -> A : feature method OR milestoneOutput(instruction, data)
note over A : Build feature/context prompt; Strategy guidance where applicable
loop At most 2 attempts; retry only malformed/invalid structured output
  A -> Adapter : generate(prompt + feedback)
  Adapter -> Client : generateContent(prompt)
  Client -> API : SDK generation request (implementation detail)
  alt Transport/configuration failure
    break Propagate transport/configuration failure; exit generation
      Client --> A : safe exception (through adapter)
      A --> F : exception; no malformed-output retry
    end
  else Text response
    API --> Client : generated content
    Client --> Adapter : response text
    Adapter --> A : response text
    A -> A : parse JSON and invoke parser callback
    alt Callback validation passes
      break Return immediately; no more attempts
        A --> F : validated result
      end
    else First invalid structured response
      note over A : Build sanitized validation feedback; retry once
    else Second invalid structured response
      break Both attempts invalid
        A --> F : PlanningException; no result returned for storage
      end
    end
  end
end
note over F,A
  F01–F06 validate feature schema within the bounded parser callback.
  milestoneOutput validates a JSON object; F07–F10 feature-field checks
  occur later in AdaptivePlanningService, outside this retry boundary.
  No fabricated offline success; no live providers called for this UML task.
end note
@enduml
